	(text "THE FRONT PANEL'S RIBBON: DISPLAYS, LEDS, TOGGLES, INPUT, RUN, LOAD, RESET" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "906ab834-b327-50a9-927b-0a3e1f59544a"))
	(text "J3, a keyed 2x25 header at the front edge (Ken, 2026-11-22): a straight 50-way ribbon to the front panel card,\npin n to pin n (tools/s5panel.py). ADR15-ADR0 and OUT7-OUT0 for its displays and bit LEDs, SW7-SW0 from its data\ntoggles, LED_Q_K for its Q LED, INPUT_RC for its INPUT button, and the bus lines -RESET, -PAUSE and -DMAIN themselves\n(RUN, LOAD, the RESET button's boot reset, the mode LEDs). ROM_LED_L = NAND(-VMA, -VMA) (U9D, open drain) sinks its\nROM LED while the CPU card's EPROM answers. SW12 RESET (2026-11-23) is this card's own boot reset, for a machine\nwith no front panel: pressed, BTN_H is high and U23A / U23B (74HC03, open drain) pull -RESET and -DMAIN low\ntogether, unless -PAUSE is low (LOAD on); the CPU card then starts in the EPROM." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2fecdfbe-cedf-5deb-8cb2-c869b9ae7038"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
